  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Map Your App Logic\r\n\r\nIn this level, you’ll create a flowchart to plan how your app works.\r\n\r\n1. Use the workspace to map how user inputs lead to outcomes.\r\n\r\n</br>\r\n\r\n2. Add conditions to show how your app makes decisions.\r\n\r\n</br>\r\n\r\n3. Include at least one combined condition (two inputs affecting one result).\r\n\r\n</br>\r\n\r\n4. Identify any key values your app needs to track (such as selections or scores).\r\n\r\nFocus on how your app behaves, not how it looks.\r\n\r\n:::details [**Tips**]\r\nStart with a user action, then show what happens step by step. You can use arrows and shapes to represent decisions and outcomes.\r\n:::",
